=== meta ===
rule: TEST_DISABLED
title: an unguarded collection hook beside a readable production edit is unexplained, not "no production change"
origin: issue #205 - conftest_collection_control_not_repaired_pos pins COLLECTION_CONTROL_UNEXPLAINED when the production edit is opaque (it grants evidence diff-wide). With a readable Python edit the <suite> unit got no evidence, and the old escalator choice printed NO_PROD_CHANGE_IN_DIFF over a diff that changes production
=== before: tests/conftest.py ===
import os
import sys

sys.path.insert(0, os.path.dirname(__file__))
=== after: tests/conftest.py ===
import os
import sys

sys.path.insert(0, os.path.dirname(__file__))


def pytest_collection_modifyitems(items):
    items[:] = [item for item in items if "wide" not in item.name]
